@startuml
title US91 — Browse Recent Events (design-level sequence diagram)

actor "Service Administrator" as Admin
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant ":RemoteAccessHttpServer" as HttpServer
participant ":RemoteAccessHttpHandler" as Handler
participant ":RemoteAccessLogStore" as Store

== Initial Page Load ==

Admin -> Browser : open http://localhost:8080/events
Browser -> HttpServer : TCP connect + GET /events HTTP/1.1
activate HttpServer
HttpServer -> Handler ** : new RemoteAccessHttpHandler(socket, store)
HttpServer -> Handler : run() [new daemon thread]
activate Handler

Handler -> Handler : readLine() → "GET /events HTTP/1.1"
Handler -> Handler : route("/events", out)
Handler -> Handler : serveStaticFile("www/events.html", ...)
Handler -> Handler : getResourceAsStream("www/events.html")
Handler --> Browser : HTTP 200 OK\n  Content-Type: text/html\n  [events.html body]
deactivate Handler
deactivate HttpServer

== AJAX Poll (triggered by onload and repeated every 1500 ms) ==

Browser -> Browser : onload → refreshEvents()
Browser -> HttpServer : TCP connect + GET /api/events HTTP/1.1
activate HttpServer
HttpServer -> Handler ** : new RemoteAccessHttpHandler(socket, store)
HttpServer -> Handler : run() [new daemon thread]
activate Handler

Handler -> Handler : readLine() → "GET /api/events HTTP/1.1"
Handler -> Handler : route("/api/events", out)
Handler -> Handler : serveEventsFragment(out)

Handler -> Store : recentEvents()
activate Store
Store --> Handler : List<RemoteAccessLogEntry> (up to 500, oldest first)
deactivate Store

Handler -> Handler : Collections.reverse(events)\n   build HTML <table>\n   for each entry: append <tr> with\n     timestamp, eventType, username,\n     clientIp, clientPort, serviceId\n   (HTML-escape all string fields)
Handler --> Browser : HTTP 200 OK\n  Content-Type: text/html\n  [<table>...</table> fragment]
deactivate Handler
deactivate HttpServer

Browser -> Browser : events.innerHTML = responseText\n   status = "Last updated: HH:mm:ss"\n   setTimeout(refreshEvents, 1500)

note over Browser
  After 1500 ms, refreshEvents() is called
  again and the cycle repeats.
  On error or timeout the page shows
  "Still trying..." and retries.
end note

@enduml
